## Covariance parameter inference

`W = 2H^{-1}` is the asymptotic covariance of the covariance parameter estimates and the
basis of every Satterthwaite degree of freedom in the package. IBM SPSS prints it under
`/PRINT=COVB`, which makes the comparison possible element by element. Eight models, 136
elements of `W`, the Type III table, a parameter on the boundary and a rank-deficient model.

```julia; echo = false
acceptance_run("VAL-SPSS", "Covariance parameter inference against SPSS") do
    include(joinpath(VALDIR, "validation_spss.jl"))
end
```

```julia; echo = false, results = "tex"
print(acceptance_note("VAL-SPSS"))
```

